{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter New York, 1920 \u2014 a city pulsing with ambition, corruption, and deadly rivalries.<br> In <strong>Silent Authority: Blood &amp; Bourbon</strong>, every street is a prize, every deal a risk, and every ally a potential traitor. From the bustling docks of Brooklyn to the velvet-lit jazz clubs of Harlem, the city is a living organism\u2014breathing, changing, and waiting to be claimed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/93e045740f2472b27d78567a7aa08445.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/93e045740f2472b27d78567a7aa08445.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/93e045740f2472b27d78567a7aa08445.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing but ambition. Recruit loyal enforcers, seize rackets from the shadows, and weave your influence through the city\u2019s underbelly. Every move shapes your legend, drawing the eyes of rival kingpins, crooked politicians, and watchful lawmen. In this world, power isn\u2019t earned\u2014it\u2019s taken, one brutal step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/a55a21a49ca8e71b25c5ab371c525f6a.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/a55a21a49ca8e71b25c5ab371c525f6a.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/a55a21a49ca8e71b25c5ab371c525f6a.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending ruthless empire-building, cinematic real-time combat, and cutthroat underworld politics, <i>Silent Authority</i> delivers a living, breathing city where no two crime dynasties rise the same way. Territories are taken and lost in blood, alliances forged in smoke-filled backrooms and broken in gunfire, and your road to power will be paved with bribes, bullets, and spilled bourbon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/2fce2827d0596a1ca3da551ded343d34.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/2fce2827d0596a1ca3da551ded343d34.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/2fce2827d0596a1ca3da551ded343d34.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/43058274287e72376aeae8799508c270.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/30d6f3cf008487c41316b3f450b4f702.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/30d6f3cf008487c41316b3f450b4f702.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/30d6f3cf008487c41316b3f450b4f702.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your character.</strong> Customize your appearance and define your core skill set from the start. Allocate attributes, select practical advantages, and shape a boss that fits your preferred approach\u2014whether built for resilience, intimidation, or efficiency. Your choices directly affect performance in combat, events, and operations, forming the foundation of your rise in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/8285d71417872af4cb8b2545c9a85dce.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your style:</strong> distribute your attributes, unlock advantages; dominate the field through choices like an intimidating stance, a solid physique, quick recovery, an extra weapon slot, and expanded loot capacity. Every choice shapes a more influential profile in events or a more resilient posture in combat\u2014this is where your playstyle takes form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/b1c7fa86ac0f800f87e9327e122e47bc.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/b965e6666a72f79c4a89b5e4b4dddd61.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/b965e6666a72f79c4a89b5e4b4dddd61.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/b965e6666a72f79c4a89b5e4b4dddd61.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the strong:\u00a0</strong>Enter third-person, map-based tactical combat where positioning matters. Face stronger enemies using authentic 1920s-era weapons, smart movement, and environmental advantage to turn the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/58ea7ada1f6fffda6b1677084be2c65e.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/36599a90690768314a1f3cb507df4cb9.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/36599a90690768314a1f3cb507df4cb9.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/36599a90690768314a1f3cb507df4cb9.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic events keep the pulse high:</strong> reports, inspection raids, rival alliance offers, mole suspicions. Bribe, intimidate, or disappear; each method affects your income, street reputation, and your crew\u2019s trust in different ways. High profit usually comes with high Pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/05b9804a2b4d931a898977bd789fa524.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/054adf9c33ecf3293cfc15bf90c67cc7.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/054adf9c33ecf3293cfc15bf90c67cc7.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/054adf9c33ecf3293cfc15bf90c67cc7.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your front business:</strong> assign a manager, upgrade levels; track the Cost / Laundering / Earnings flow daily-weekly-monthly. Launch Smuggling with a single click, balance profitability and risk, and expand your operation chain. Grow your vault through fronts like restaurants, tailors, and shoemakers; every upgrade brings new opportunities and efficiency boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/7a8a95d5f0d562516955f839de8628d0.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/d4d2aee9da3e51e44e82d1b7a543307f.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/d4d2aee9da3e51e44e82d1b7a543307f.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/d4d2aee9da3e51e44e82d1b7a543307f.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your crew, set the operation, move quietly:</strong> distribute tasks, regulate the flow, collect the outcome. Run the front, feed the vault, stay unnoticed; sense danger, change course, evaluate risks. When the knock comes at the door, decide fast flip the table, seize the advantage; read the board, decode the data, refresh the plan. Lower Pressure, raise Respect, and rule the city from behind the curtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907570?t=1774428870","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/cb017b668e6670d789c0df61caffb05bdbd49e36/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774428870","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/a8be74c3003c4b10704a58e0e373f9aa51c34222/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774428870","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/a8be74c3003c4b10704a58e0e373f9aa51c34222/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774428870","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mature themes including organized crime, gun violence, and depictions of alcohol use. Some narrative elements may involve intimidation, extortion, and illegal trade, represented in a fictional 1920s setting. There is no explicit sexual content or depictions of drug use."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter New York, 1920 \u2014 a city pulsing with ambition, corruption, and deadly rivalries.<br> In <strong>Silent Authority: Blood &amp; Bourbon</strong>, every street is a prize, every deal a risk, and every ally a potential traitor. From the bustling docks of Brooklyn to the velvet-lit jazz clubs of Harlem, the city is a living organism\u2014breathing, changing, and waiting to be claimed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/93e045740f2472b27d78567a7aa08445.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/93e045740f2472b27d78567a7aa08445.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/93e045740f2472b27d78567a7aa08445.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing but ambition. Recruit loyal enforcers, seize rackets from the shadows, and weave your influence through the city\u2019s underbelly. Every move shapes your legend, drawing the eyes of rival kingpins, crooked politicians, and watchful lawmen. In this world, power isn\u2019t earned\u2014it\u2019s taken, one brutal step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/a55a21a49ca8e71b25c5ab371c525f6a.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/a55a21a49ca8e71b25c5ab371c525f6a.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/a55a21a49ca8e71b25c5ab371c525f6a.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending ruthless empire-building, cinematic real-time combat, and cutthroat underworld politics, <i>Silent Authority</i> delivers a living, breathing city where no two crime dynasties rise the same way. Territories are taken and lost in blood, alliances forged in smoke-filled backrooms and broken in gunfire, and your road to power will be paved with bribes, bullets, and spilled bourbon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/2fce2827d0596a1ca3da551ded343d34.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/2fce2827d0596a1ca3da551ded343d34.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst