s/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/718dd038ce75406c8e5b2a735d639b8b.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your style:</strong> distribute your attributes, unlock advantages; dominate the field through choices like an intimidating stance, a solid physique, quick recovery, an extra weapon slot, and expanded loot capacity. Every choice shapes a more influential profile in events or a more resilient posture in combat\u2014this is where your playstyle takes form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/b1c7fa86ac0f800f87e9327e122e47bc.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/b965e6666a72f79c4a89b5e4b4dddd61.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/b965e6666a72f79c4a89b5e4b4dddd61.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/b965e6666a72f79c4a89b5e4b4dddd61.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the strong:\u00a0</strong>Enter third-person, map-based tactical combat where positioning matters. Face stronger enemies using authentic 1920s-era weapons, smart movement, and environmental advantage to turn the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/58ea7ada1f6fffda6b1677084be2c65e.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/36599a90690768314a1f3cb507df4cb9.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/36599a90690768314a1f3cb507df4cb9.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/36599a90690768314a1f3cb507df4cb9.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic events keep the pulse high:</strong> reports, inspection raids, rival alliance offers, mole suspicions. Bribe, intimidate, or disappear; each method affects your income, street reputation, and your crew\u2019s trust in different ways. High profit usually comes with high Pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/05b9804a2b4d931a898977bd789fa524.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/054adf9c33ecf3293cfc15bf90c67cc7.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/054adf9c33ecf3293cfc15bf90c67cc7.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/054adf9c33ecf3293cfc15bf90c67cc7.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your front business:</strong> assign a manager, upgrade levels; track the Cost / Laundering / Earnings flow daily-weekly-monthly. Launch Smuggling with a single click, balance profitability and risk, and expand your operation chain. Grow your vault through fronts like restaurants, tailors, and shoemakers; every upgrade brings new opportunities and efficiency boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/7a8a95d5f0d562516955f839de8628d0.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1600 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/d4d2aee9da3e51e44e82d1b7a543307f.poster.avif?t=1774428870\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/d4d2aee9da3e51e44e82d1b7a543307f.webm?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/extras/d4d2aee9da3e51e44e82d1b7a543307f.mp4?t=1774428870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your crew, set the operation, move quietly:</strong> distribute tasks, regulate the flow, collect the outcome. Run the front, feed the vault, stay unnoticed; sense danger, change course, evaluate risks. When the knock comes at the door, decide fast flip the table, seize the advantage; read the board, decode the data, refresh the plan. Lower Pressure, raise Respect, and rule the city from behind the curtain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Complex Universe"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907570/c9a491f1703ae82b5cdf272415132cdd70edb3e5/header.jpg?t=1774428870","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights regarding the use, application, and dissemination of the ideas and designs included in the attachment, particularly in relation to discussions on potential investment or other cooperative endeavors, are exclusively reserved by Complex Universe Bili\u015fim Teknoloji ve Ticaret Limited \u015eirketi. Unauthorized use, sharing, or distribution of these ideas and designs with any third parties, institutions, or organizations is strictly prohibited without explicit written consent from our company. Any breach of these terms may result in legal action.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Silent Authority: Blood & Bourbon","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti or AMD RX 560<br></li><li><